  <rdf:Description rdf:nodeID="commodity_levyrsmolt_cb0">
    <crm:P190_has_symbolic_content>either lard or fat (= smolt) of liver or of the liver of the young salmon when it migrates to the sea for the first time or cod-liver oil, the oil expressed from the liver of the cod, much used in medicine (OED s.v. cod-liver oil) | cod-liver oil, the oil expressed from the liver of the cod, much used in medicine (OED s.v. cod-liver oil) | lard or fat (= smolt) of liver or the liver of the young salmon when it migrates to the sea for the first time (= smolt) (OED s.v. smolt sb.1; MED s.v. smolt n. 1)</crm:P190_has_symbolic_content>
    <crm:P2_has_type rdf:resource="http://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300435416"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E33_Linguistic_Object"/>
